  { q: "What file types can it read?", a: "It reads a syllabus as a PDF, a DOCX, or pasted plain text. The Best Answer Hub Syllabus Deadline Extractor parses PDF and DOCX in the browser using open standards, so you can use whichever format your instructor provided." },
