      <ul class="sources">
        <li>Mozilla, <a href="https://mozilla.github.io/pdf.js/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PDF.js</a> (in-browser PDF parsing) and Ecma, <a href="https://ecma-international.org/publications-and-standards/standards/ecma-376/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ECMA-376</a> (DOCX / Office Open XML).</li>
        <li>IETF, <a href="https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc5545/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">RFC 5545, iCalendar</a> (the .ics format Google, Apple, and Outlook import).</li>
        <li>ISO, <a href="https://www.iso.org/iso-8601-date-and-time-format.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ISO 8601 date and time format</a> (the unambiguous YYYY-MM-DD form).</li>
        <li>FTC, <a href="https://www.ftc.gov/business-guidance/resources/protecting-personal-information-guide-business" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Protecting Personal Information</a> and NIST, <a href="https://nvlpubs.nist.gov/nistpubs/legacy/sp/nistspecialpublication800-122.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">SP 800-122</a> (data minimization).</li>
        <li>Northern Illinois University, <a href="https://www.niu.edu/academic-support/student-guides/using-calendars-and-planners.shtml" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Using Calendars and Planners</a> and <a href="https://files.eric.ed.gov/fulltext/EJ1271877.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Online Learning Journal, 2020</a> (map all dates; late-penalty norms).</li>
      </ul>
